If the Government says that public service pensions are important and that a provision must be set aside to fulfil its contractual obligation I have to ask LEUNG Chun (-) ying why his promise of setting aside funding for resolving retirement problems as mentioned in his Manifesto has not been honoured
With these remarks Deputy Chairman I oppose the whole Budget
